17. Troubleshooting Results from Our Project
Issue	Root cause	Resolution
Worker could not communicate with master API	Network connectivity issue	Verified TCP 6443 using nc
Worker pod DNS timeout	Calico IP-in-IP traffic blocked	Added AWS Security Group IP protocol 4
CoreDNS lookup failed from worker	Cross-node pod networking failure	Fixed IP-in-IP communication
Argo CD could not resolve main branch	Repository branch was master	Changed targetRevision to master
Argo CD OutOfSync	Node Exporter Service referenced missing namespace	Removed unwanted manifest from repository; remote deletion still needed verification
Browser connection refused	Application exposure was not ready at the earlier test	Deployed Zomato and configured NodePort 30001
