Important scope and command notes
1. This is a consolidated project runbook, not an exported terminal history. It includes the setup sequence and troubleshooting commands discussed across the conversations. Some initial installation commands are reconstructed as standard kubeadm setup steps where the complete original terminal history is unavailable.
2. Commands using <TOKEN> and <CA_HASH> require the actual values generated by your cluster.
3. The kubeadm init, Calico installation and Argo CD installation commands are setup commands; do not rerun them on an already working cluster without a specific reason.
4. Commands that change AWS Security Groups or EC2 source/destination checks are performed in the AWS console unless you explicitly use AWS CLI.
5. Prometheus, Grafana and Node Exporter are excluded from the project deployment.
6. Do not expose the Argo CD dashboard or NodePort to the entire internet without appropriate access restrictions.
End of project command reference.

